{"id":1586,"title":"树形数据结构","summary":"导言","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d9edaa85-b5d1-3099-9e8f-4eda248bcf3d","knowledge_id":657,"title":"导言","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":657,"title":"导言","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"dcfd4ebb-1f2b-383b-90f7-6872822b61e0","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**树** 是一种 **非线性**数据结构，表示各种元素之间的**关系**，便于**搜索**。\n\n树的主要目的是有效地进行**多层级**的**数据组织**。","text_html":"<p><strong>树</strong> 是一种 <strong>非线性</strong>数据结构，表示各种元素之间的<strong>关系</strong>，便于<strong>搜索</strong>。</p>\n<p>树的主要目的是有效地进行<strong>多层级</strong>的<strong>数据组织</strong>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5897518a-2f27-335c-8a07-50d322f38a7b","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/ea2341de912846e42193.png","style":"original","caption":"General Tree","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":556,"size_in_bytes":27683,"name":"dsa-10.2.1.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7aad0e1f-2142-3eeb-8bea-f5a3011f70d0","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在这里：\n\n- 圆圈是**结点** `Node`\n- 线是**边** `Edge`\n\n在树形结构中，**结点**`Node`是单个元素，**边**`Edge`连接这些结点，表示关系。","text_html":"<p>在这里：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>圆圈是<strong>结点</strong> <code>Node</code></li>\n<li>线是<strong>边</strong> <code>Edge</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>在树形结构中，<strong>结点</strong><code>Node</code>是单个元素，<strong>边</strong><code>Edge</code>连接这些结点，表示关系。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"88cb91f0-34b9-3d4c-84af-07a2e1e6fba2","knowledge_id":658,"title":"现实生活类比：电子商务平台","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":658,"title":"现实生活类比：电子商务平台","knowledges":[{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7d205983-c74d-3208-b226-9c9bb6b48d66","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/f7a5d02d95a9a5a7a5de.png","style":"original","caption":"Trees in E-commerce","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1306,"height":754,"size_in_bytes":36824,"name":"dsa-10.2.2.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f4b11c6b-e1ca-33eb-830f-1675d60f8480","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在这里，我们使用树结构对**电子商务**平台的产品**进行了分层**组织\n\n**结点**表示产品类别和子类别，而**边**则表示它们在平台中的连接或关联方式。\n\n这样可以清楚地表达层级，有效的管理数据。","text_html":"<p>在这里，我们使用树结构对<strong>电子商务</strong>平台的产品<strong>进行了分层</strong>组织</p>\n<p><strong>结点</strong>表示产品类别和子类别，而<strong>边</strong>则表示它们在平台中的连接或关联方式。</p>\n<p>这样可以清楚地表达层级，有效的管理数据。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":1}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e69c61a8-d911-36cb-9754-f7f641f56e0b","knowledge_id":659,"title":"为什么要使用树？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":659,"title":"为什么要使用树？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"0df587b8-362d-3add-a843-fa09bbad9edb","title":"","title_html":"","text":"让我们举一个实际的例子来理解为什么要使用树。\n\n在文件系统中，一个目录可以有多个子目录。每个子目录都可以进一步包含其他目录和文件。\n\n假设**我的文档**目录包含三个子目录：\n\n- **音乐** Music\n- **图片** Pictures\n- **工作** Work\n\n在**Music**目录下，有两个文件。\n\n- **M1**\n- **M2**\n\n在**Pictures**目录下，有两个文件。\n\n- **P1**\n- **P2**\n\n而**Work**目录是空的。\n\n## 使用列表存储数据\n\n假设尝试使用列表来存储这些信息，如下图：","text_html":"<p>让我们举一个实际的例子来理解为什么要使用树。</p>\n<p>在文件系统中，一个目录可以有多个子目录。每个子目录都可以进一步包含其他目录和文件。</p>\n<p>假设<strong>我的文档</strong>目录包含三个子目录：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>音乐</strong> Music</li>\n<li><strong>图片</strong> Pictures</li>\n<li><strong>工作</strong> Work</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在<strong>Music</strong>目录下，有两个文件。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>M1</strong></li>\n<li><strong>M2</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>在<strong>Pictures</strong>目录下，有两个文件。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>P1</strong></li>\n<li><strong>P2</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>而<strong>Work</strong>目录是空的。</p>\n<h2>使用列表存储数据</h2>\n<p>假设尝试使用列表来存储这些信息，如下图：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"94ebabbd-cd4f-33c8-8ae4-ba28ad91f81b","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/89506dd90c22d2f8a7ba.png","style":"original","caption":"Using List to Store Data","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1298,"height":248,"size_in_bytes":8041,"name":"dsa-10.2.3.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c83d4522-6034-316b-8665-73c28b4c1270","title":"","title_html":"","text":"该列表提供了所有目录和文件的名称。\n\n不过，它并不提供这些文件在**我的文档**中的**结构**，无法清楚地知道目录与文件之间的包含关系\n\n## 使用树形结构存储数据\n\n如果使用一棵树来表示这些数据。","text_html":"<p>该列表提供了所有目录和文件的名称。</p>\n<p>不过，它并不提供这些文件在<strong>我的文档</strong>中的<strong>结构</strong>，无法清楚地知道目录与文件之间的包含关系</p>\n<h2>使用树形结构存储数据</h2>\n<p>如果使用一棵树来表示这些数据。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"edd8d4d5-8709-3bba-a740-611bf8a3b603","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/374660bcb534fe115783.png","style":"original","caption":"Using Tree to Store Data","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":584,"size_in_bytes":25957,"name":"dsa-10.2.4.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6df5fae7-a820-37af-97d2-10a191958af4","title":"","title_html":"","text":"这棵树清楚地显示了**我的文档**(MyDocuments)的内容。\n\n此外，它还显示了哪些文件/目录属于哪个父目录。","text_html":"<p>这棵树清楚地显示了<strong>我的文档</strong>(MyDocuments)的内容。</p>\n<p>此外，它还显示了哪些文件/目录属于哪个父目录。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c69daa3a-d881-3925-b390-b8bf27c7b231","knowledge_id":660,"title":"树中的关系","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":3,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":660,"title":"树中的关系","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"92cb8e2f-e7c2-39d0-b716-2b682e4bca14","title":"","title_html":"","text":"树形数据结构的灵感来自家族树，家族树使用**父母**、**子女**、**兄弟姐妹、祖先**和**后代**等术语来描述关系。\n\n因此，树中的关系是有**等级**的，元素在其他元素之上、之下或处于同一等级。","text_html":"<p>树形数据结构的灵感来自家族树，家族树使用<strong>父母</strong>、<strong>子女</strong>、<strong>兄弟姐妹、祖先</strong>和<strong>后代</strong>等术语来描述关系。</p>\n<p>因此，树中的关系是有<strong>等级</strong>的，元素在其他元素之上、之下或处于同一等级。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b7d9e3a3-9daf-3706-98ed-a1e3a87055fa","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/1c23cd2b84ad60e3aa7e.png","style":"original","caption":"Family Tree","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":1025,"size_in_bytes":35093,"name":"dsa-10.2.5.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"df8e3529-be81-368c-aece-bff43883e25c","title":"","title_html":"","text":"树中的关系是：\n\n**1.父结点**\n\n在层次结构中，当前节点正上方的连接节点称为**父结点**。\n\n**2.子结点**\n\n某结点正下方的连接结点是其**子结点**。\n\n**3.同级结点**\n\n树中的**同级结点**共享同一个父结点。它们在层次结构中处于同一层次。","text_html":"<p>树中的关系是：</p>\n<p><strong>1.父结点</strong></p>\n<p>在层次结构中，当前节点正上方的连接节点称为<strong>父结点</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>2.子结点</strong></p>\n<p>某结点正下方的连接结点是其<strong>子结点</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>3.同级结点</strong></p>\n<p>树中的<strong>同级结点</strong>共享同一个父结点。它们在层次结构中处于同一层次。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"QuestionRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c4916d18-34fc-38b6-b221-f887467586a6","title":"树结点的关系","question_id":3236,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":4,"resolved":{"question_id":3236,"title":"树结点的关系","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"树中结点之间的关系是___?","question_text_html":"<p>树中结点之间的关系是___?</p>\n","question_options":[{"id":11369,"key":"A","text":"分层次","text_html":"<p>分层次</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"树中的结点有层次","md_html":"<p>树中的结点有层次</p>\n"},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11370,"key":"B","text":"线性排列","text_html":"<p>线性排列</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"树是一种非线性数据结构。","md_html":"<p>树是一种非线性数据结构。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11371,"key":"C","text":"结点之间没有关系","text_html":"<p>结点之间没有关系</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"树中结点有关系","md_html":"<p>树中结点有关系</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11372,"key":"D","text":"以上都不是","text_html":"<p>以上都不是</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"上述选项中有一个是正确的","md_html":"<p>上述选项中有一个是正确的</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}},{"type":"QuestionRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d5a96bb3-a564-3822-8225-7e7138cd85f8","title":"树结点","question_id":3237,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":5,"resolved":{"question_id":3237,"title":"树结点","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"在树形数据结构中，同一父结点的两个子结点被称为___ ?","question_text_html":"<p>在树形数据结构中，同一父结点的两个子结点被称为___ ?</p>\n","question_options":[{"id":11373,"key":"A","text":"祖先","text_html":"<p>祖先</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"祖先是树中一个结点上方的所有连接结点。","md_html":"<p>祖先是树中一个结点上方的所有连接结点。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11374,"key":"B","text":"子结点","text_html":"<p>子结点</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"子结点是树中落在某个结点下面的所有结点。","md_html":"<p>子结点是树中落在某个结点下面的所有结点。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11375,"key":"C","text":"兄弟结点","text_html":"<p>兄弟结点</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"同一父结点的子结点为兄弟结点。","md_html":"<p>同一父结点的子结点为兄弟结点。</p>\n"},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11376,"key":"D","text":"以上都是","text_html":"<p>以上都是</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"上述选项中只有一个是正确的。","md_html":"<p>上述选项中只有一个是正确的。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"68929cb1-64d5-3e40-ae75-fa0c7afd8609","knowledge_id":661,"title":"树结构","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":6,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":661,"title":"树结构","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"196608aa-7c3b-3d1c-82cf-01a60fbdb77b","title":"","title_html":"","text":"让我们来看看树形结构。","text_html":"<p>让我们来看看树形结构。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7681ddc-2acc-3843-aa33-609059f29f64","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/94c6e5f6306dfcee7742.png","style":"original","caption":"Root and Leaf Nodes in Tree","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1306,"height":761,"size_in_bytes":34105,"name":"dsa-10.2.6.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"31f8f1d2-9713-34c0-87e1-28a557a94163","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在这里：\n\n- 没有父结点的**顶端**结点称为**根结点** `Root`。\n- 没有子结点的结点称为**叶结点** `Leaf`。\n\n一棵树只能有一个**根结点**。","text_html":"<p>在这里：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>没有父结点的<strong>顶端</strong>结点称为<strong>根结点</strong> <code>Root</code>。</li>\n<li>没有子结点的结点称为<strong>叶结点</strong> <code>Leaf</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一棵树只能有一个<strong>根结点</strong>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Note","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4735b3c7-ce50-38bf-bc8d-b2c74d94383d","text":"在数据结构中，通常把叶结点称为**外部结点**，而把所有其他结称为**内部结点**。","text_html":"<p>在数据结构中，通常把叶结点称为<strong>外部结点</strong>，而把所有其他结称为<strong>内部结点</strong>。</p>"},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"54c0e932-d566-3689-9f3d-f5cdb3cc3133","title":"","title_html":"","text":"既然知道了这些术语，就可以研究结点的属性了。","text_html":"<p>既然知道了这些术语，就可以研究结点的属性了。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4}]}},{"type":"QuestionRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"df59ffaa-4d0b-398a-a0c8-93edb8d76c18","title":"父结点","question_id":3238,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":7,"resolved":{"question_id":3238,"title":"父结点","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"在树形数据结构中，什么是父结点？","question_text_html":"<p>在树形数据结构中，什么是父结点？</p>\n","question_options":[{"id":11377,"key":"A","text":"没有子结点的结点","text_html":"<p>没有子结点的结点</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"父结点必须有子结点","md_html":"<p>父结点必须有子结点</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11378,"key":"B","text":"从另一个结点派生出来的结点。","text_html":"<p>从另一个结点派生出来的结点。</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"父结点可以从其他结点衍生而来，但这不是主要标准。","md_html":"<p>父结点可以从其他结点衍生而来，但这不是主要标准。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11379,"key":"C","text":"能派生出子结点","text_html":"<p>能派生出子结点</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"父结点派生出称为子结点的结点","md_html":"<p>父结点派生出称为子结点的结点</p>\n"},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11380,"key":"D","text":"位于树最底部的结点。","text_html":"<p>位于树最底部的结点。</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"父结点不能位于树的底部","md_html":"<p>父结点不能位于树的底部</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8b9a5934-2aad-303b-a74a-d26aeb4dbf8e","knowledge_id":662,"title":"结点深度","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":8,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":662,"title":"结点深度","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4052876e-ef90-3011-b5e3-7f2034cfbcd8","title":"","title_html":"","text":"树中结点的**深度**是指从根结点到该结点的路径长度。\n\n**深度**是用从根结点到达特定结点所需的边的数量来衡量的。\n\n根结点的深度为**0**，因为它没有任何祖先。","text_html":"<p>树中结点的<strong>深度</strong>是指从根结点到该结点的路径长度。</p>\n<p><strong>深度</strong>是用从根结点到达特定结点所需的边的数量来衡量的。</p>\n<p>根结点的深度为<strong>0</strong>，因为它没有任何祖先。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"dc51d3fd-a7b1-39be-a8b3-5013231f5a74","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/1c2659ea769d9c821da0.png","style":"original","caption":"Depth of a Node","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":789,"size_in_bytes":35121,"name":"dsa-10.2.7.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"9315940b-289d-33f8-ad52-6319a44409f3","title":"","title_html":"","text":"以上述示例树为例：\n\n- 结点**A**位于深度**0**，因为它是**根结点**。\n- 结点**B**和**C**位于深度**1**，因为它们距离根结点**一条边**。\n- 结点**D**、**E**和**F**位于深度**2**，因为它们是根节结下面的**两条边**。\n- 结点**G**位于深度**3**，因为它是根下面的**三条边**。","text_html":"<p>以上述示例树为例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>结点<strong>A</strong>位于深度<strong>0</strong>，因为它是<strong>根结点</strong>。</li>\n<li>结点<strong>B</strong>和<strong>C</strong>位于深度<strong>1</strong>，因为它们距离根结点<strong>一条边</strong>。</li>\n<li>结点<strong>D</strong>、<strong>E</strong>和<strong>F</strong>位于深度<strong>2</strong>，因为它们是根节结下面的<strong>两条边</strong>。</li>\n<li>结点<strong>G</strong>位于深度<strong>3</strong>，因为它是根下面的<strong>三条边</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a978ab08-b101-3d45-ac75-53174ee803ac","knowledge_id":663,"title":"结点高度","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":9,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":663,"title":"结点高度","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"9a3c07f1-839e-330b-80ab-f40f3cfb773b","title":"","title_html":"","text":"树中结点的**高度**是指从该结点到**后代**叶结点之间最长路径的长度。\n\n高度是用从结点到最深子结点所遇到的边的数量来衡量的。\n\n由于**叶结点**没有子结点，因此其高度为**0**。","text_html":"<p>树中结点的<strong>高度</strong>是指从该结点到<strong>后代</strong>叶结点之间最长路径的长度。</p>\n<p>高度是用从结点到最深子结点所遇到的边的数量来衡量的。</p>\n<p>由于<strong>叶结点</strong>没有子结点，因此其高度为<strong>0</strong>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5c65065e-25c3-37cc-8116-b22c64ad26c4","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/5ff02cd56f260e3f8bc4.png","style":"original","caption":"Height of a Node","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":789,"size_in_bytes":35197,"name":"dsa-10.2.8.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"882e57dc-4689-3ff0-a59b-8003b841a9bb","title":"","title_html":"","text":"以上图示例树为例：\n\n- 结点**A**的高度为**3**，因为从**A**到叶结点的最长路径是**三条**边。\n- 结点**C**的高度为**2**，因为从**C**到叶结点的最长路径是**两条**边。\n- 结点**B**和**F**的高度为**1**，因为从它们到叶结点的最长路径是**一条**边。\n- 结点**D**、**E**和**G**的高度为**0**，因为它们是叶结点。","text_html":"<p>以上图示例树为例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>结点<strong>A</strong>的高度为<strong>3</strong>，因为从<strong>A</strong>到叶结点的最长路径是<strong>三条</strong>边。</li>\n<li>结点<strong>C</strong>的高度为<strong>2</strong>，因为从<strong>C</strong>到叶结点的最长路径是<strong>两条</strong>边。</li>\n<li>结点<strong>B</strong>和<strong>F</strong>的高度为<strong>1</strong>，因为从它们到叶结点的最长路径是<strong>一条</strong>边。</li>\n<li>结点<strong>D</strong>、<strong>E</strong>和<strong>G</strong>的高度为<strong>0</strong>，因为它们是叶结点。</li>\n</ul>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"QuestionRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"45c1658b-b607-3a64-8744-9753fdd06835","title":"结点高度和深度","question_id":3239,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":10,"resolved":{"question_id":3239,"title":"结点高度和深度","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"关于树结点的高度和深度，以下哪些说法是正确的？","question_text_html":"<p>关于树结点的高度和深度，以下哪些说法是正确的？</p>\n","question_options":[{"id":11381,"key":"A","text":"叶结点的高度总是等于根结点的深度。","text_html":"<p>叶结点的高度总是等于根结点的深度。</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"叶结点的高度和根结点的深度均为0。","md_html":"<p>叶结点的高度和根结点的深度均为0。</p>\n"},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11382,"key":"B","text":"叶结点的高度总是等于叶结点的深度。","text_html":"<p>叶结点的高度总是等于叶结点的深度。</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"叶结点的高度为0，但深度不一定等于0。","md_html":"<p>叶结点的高度为0，但深度不一定等于0。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11383,"key":"C","text":"根结点的深度总是等于根结点的高度。","text_html":"<p>根结点的深度总是等于根结点的高度。</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"根结点的深度为0，但高度不一定为0。","md_html":"<p>根结点的深度为0，但高度不一定为0。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11384,"key":"D","text":"以上都不是","text_html":"<p>以上都不是</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"上述选项中有一个是正确的。","md_html":"<p>上述选项中有一个是正确的。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5b624303-1d97-3f0e-a5b6-17390e8c1735","knowledge_id":664,"title":"树高","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":11,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":664,"title":"树高","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"9e154f25-b4ec-3a25-b14c-e24e8c9bb161","title":"","title_html":"","text":"既然已经熟悉了计算树中任意结点的高度和深度，那么了解整棵树的高度就相对容易了。\n\n结合图像来看看目前收集到的信息。","text_html":"<p>既然已经熟悉了计算树中任意结点的高度和深度，那么了解整棵树的高度就相对容易了。</p>\n<p>结合图像来看看目前收集到的信息。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"78d85975-3911-3209-bacf-6ef6481f1c41","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/305d6dedc9203ae44e03.png","style":"original","caption":"Height of a Tree","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":883,"size_in_bytes":42090,"name":"dsa-10.2.9.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"fa27adf2-2b02-31a5-b289-95a3661492b1","title":"","title_html":"","text":"整棵树的高度就是根结点的**高度**或最深结点的**深度**。\n\n在这种情况下，树的高度和深度都是**3**。","text_html":"<p>整棵树的高度就是根结点的<strong>高度</strong>或最深结点的<strong>深度</strong>。</p>\n<p>在这种情况下，树的高度和深度都是<strong>3</strong>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"cf739a10-3c45-311a-9fae-fa91e4bd870e","knowledge_id":665,"title":"结点的度","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":12,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":665,"title":"结点的度","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"1cff6960-1e9a-370c-83e2-7209065f5b65","title":"","title_html":"","text":"结点的**度**(`degree`)是结点的子结点数。\n它是一个整数值，可以让更好地了解树的结构。","text_html":"<p>结点的<strong>度</strong>(<code>degree</code>)是结点的子结点数。\n它是一个整数值，可以让更好地了解树的结构。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e4c8b285-0621-3e00-bfc6-5a03be30b1e2","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/5a7b7d902a18bda34a6a.png","style":"original","caption":"Degree of a Node","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":749,"size_in_bytes":49898,"name":"dsa-10.2.10.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"bfb1d187-bc16-3339-9a22-448878a2de00","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在此树上：\n\n- 结点**A**的度为**2**，因为它有**两个**子结点（**B**和**C**）。\n- 结点**B**的度是**3**，因为它有**三个**子结点（**D、E**和**F**）。\n- 结点**C**的度为**1**，因为它有**一个**子结点（**G**）。\n- 结点**G**的度为**1**，因为它有**一个**子结点（**H**）。\n- 结点**D**、结点**E**、结点**F**和结点**H**的度为**0**，因为它们没有任何子结点（叶结点）。","text_html":"<p>在此树上：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>结点<strong>A</strong>的度为<strong>2</strong>，因为它有<strong>两个</strong>子结点（<strong>B</strong>和<strong>C</strong>）。</li>\n<li>结点<strong>B</strong>的度是<strong>3</strong>，因为它有<strong>三个</strong>子结点（<strong>D、E</strong>和<strong>F</strong>）。</li>\n<li>结点<strong>C</strong>的度为<strong>1</strong>，因为它有<strong>一个</strong>子结点（<strong>G</strong>）。</li>\n<li>结点<strong>G</strong>的度为<strong>1</strong>，因为它有<strong>一个</strong>子结点（<strong>H</strong>）。</li>\n<li>结点<strong>D</strong>、结点<strong>E</strong>、结点<strong>F</strong>和结点<strong>H</strong>的度为<strong>0</strong>，因为它们没有任何子结点（叶结点）。</li>\n</ul>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"528f226b-51ad-32e1-b768-326bab0e4c57","knowledge_id":666,"title":"树的度","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":13,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":666,"title":"树的度","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6ef5aaf2-1a52-36b9-a08a-7b30ea0835d4","title":"","title_html":"","text":"树的**度**是树中任何结点的最大度数。","text_html":"<p>树的<strong>度</strong>是树中任何结点的最大度数。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"dfb2163c-189e-3fbf-8896-9dba9bcef6b1","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/625be66051ca2aaad0d4.png","style":"original","caption":"Degree of a Tree","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1306,"height":749,"size_in_bytes":48616,"name":"dsa-10.2.11.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5e008ac3-911e-3f81-9b27-aed332dfe05c","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在例子中，树的**度**是**3**，因为它是任何结点（**B**）的最大度数。","text_html":"<p>在例子中，树的<strong>度</strong>是<strong>3</strong>，因为它是任何结点（<strong>B</strong>）的最大度数。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"QuestionRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e03eb36f-929f-3a19-a45d-421b5dea6f74","title":"单子树的度","question_id":3240,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":14,"resolved":{"question_id":3240,"title":"单子树的度","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"只有一个结点的树（单子树）的度是多少？","question_text_html":"<p>只有一个结点的树（单子树）的度是多少？</p>\n","question_options":[{"id":11385,"key":"A","text":"0","text_html":"<p>0</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"树的唯一结点没有子结点。","md_html":"<p>树的唯一结点没有子结点。</p>\n"},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11386,"key":"B","text":"1","text_html":"<p>1</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"树中没有子结点","md_html":"<p>树中没有子结点</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11387,"key":"C","text":"2","text_html":"<p>2</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"树中没有子结点","md_html":"<p>树中没有子结点</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11388,"key":"D","text":"未定义","text_html":"<p>未定义</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"即使树中没有子结点，也存在度。","md_html":"<p>即使树中没有子结点，也存在度。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"9ecc6c7f-e641-33d0-a39d-63ac867ec936","knowledge_id":667,"title":"树的层次","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":15,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":667,"title":"树的层次","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5028e812-db7a-3b66-a96a-f56dd40d98de","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在树形数据结构中，结点排列在不同的层次上(`Level`)。\n\n- 根结点位于第 **0** 层。\n- 与根结点直接相连的结点称为 **层1** 结点。\n- 每个**层1**结点可以有自己的一组子结点，这些子结点成为**层 2** 结点。\n\n当我们沿着树往下看时，每一组来自特定层次的子结点都会增加层次编号，直到我们到达最低层次的最深结点。","text_html":"<p>在树形数据结构中，结点排列在不同的层次上(<code>Level</code>)。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>根结点位于第 <strong>0</strong> 层。</li>\n<li>与根结点直接相连的结点称为 <strong>层1</strong> 结点。</li>\n<li>每个<strong>层1</strong>结点可以有自己的一组子结点，这些子结点成为<strong>层 2</strong> 结点。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>当我们沿着树往下看时，每一组来自特定层次的子结点都会增加层次编号，直到我们到达最低层次的最深结点。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"1cfbe203-46c0-39ba-8df4-b4ba0238d2ef","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/bc007f05a00b37bb6c3c.png","style":"original","caption":"Levels of a Tree","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":749,"size_in_bytes":38166,"name":"dsa-10.2.12.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"Note","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8f88ac35-1501-321f-80d4-805f0bbfc92c","text":"树的最大层次取决于树的高度。","text_html":"<p>树的最大层次取决于树的高度。</p>"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7b53b124-0a60-368a-99c7-9e4d835b78cc","knowledge_id":668,"title":"子树","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":16,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":668,"title":"子树","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"bf603451-ff6a-3a84-980a-3416cc1bf05d","title":"","title_html":"","text":"子树是从特定结点派生出来的树的一部分。这个结点被称为**子树**。\n\n子树保留了原树的层次关系和结构。\n\n假设我们有这样一棵树：","text_html":"<p>子树是从特定结点派生出来的树的一部分。这个结点被称为<strong>子树</strong>。</p>\n<p>子树保留了原树的层次关系和结构。</p>\n<p>假设我们有这样一棵树：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b077034f-c13f-3816-9799-1023383ab0d3","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/75298f70d5ea536dfc52.png","style":"original","caption":"Example Tree","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":749,"size_in_bytes":29611,"name":"dsa-10.2.13.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a539f4f2-bbe2-3260-8936-c48e8affebaa","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在我们的示例树中，可以得到以下几组子树：\n\n**1.以结点 B 为根的子树：B、D 和 E**。","text_html":"<p>在我们的示例树中，可以得到以下几组子树：</p>\n<p><strong>1.以结点 B 为根的子树：B、D 和 E</strong>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ffcaf219-4cb3-3d5c-a063-40507c9efe09","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/d73a58dab1b87b0afe0e.png","style":"original","caption":"Subtree Rooted at B","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1306,"height":489,"size_in_bytes":14754,"name":"dsa-10.2.14.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d297e32f-ab2a-31e4-9e35-60ac96bb1e0f","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**2.以结点 C 为根的子树：C、F 和 G.**","text_html":"<p><strong>2.以结点 C 为根的子树：C、F 和 G.</strong></p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d212ce54-2cc3-3da9-9851-f0d9b0484bfd","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/52872680daa849a5cbf8.png","style":"original","caption":"Subtree Rooted at C","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":705,"size_in_bytes":19185,"name":"dsa-10.2.15.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c39e3989-3a47-3a09-9104-eeb6dc278f99","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**3.根结点 F 的子树：F 和 G.**","text_html":"<p><strong>3.根结点 F 的子树：F 和 G.</strong></p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":6},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"78d85eb2-44ca-3342-abbe-a885f75089fe","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/5bfde4be50a191b90c87.png","style":"original","caption":"Subtree Rooted at F","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":509,"size_in_bytes":12081,"name":"dsa-10.2.16.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":7}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ae0ba20f-ab65-3658-89e9-135b97254391","knowledge_id":669,"title":"森林","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":17,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":669,"title":"森林","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c0da6783-06cf-3309-802a-e80ce3d87bfe","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在数据结构中，**森林**是一组互不影响的树。\n\n不相互连接或相互作用的独立树是组合成为森林的一种方法。","text_html":"<p>在数据结构中，<strong>森林</strong>是一组互不影响的树。</p>\n<p>不相互连接或相互作用的独立树是组合成为森林的一种方法。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"46a54410-7bb2-312e-87c6-804710511943","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/5b3b4166374210b17cd1.png","style":"original","caption":"Forest as a Set of Independent Trees","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":483,"size_in_bytes":28443,"name":"dsa-10.2.17.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"cde9b060-74e6-314d-8c13-14fe165561ac","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在上图中，三棵独立的树组成了一片森林。\n\n不过，也可以通过简单地移除树中的某些结点来创建森林。\n\n让我们来看一个例子。","text_html":"<p>在上图中，三棵独立的树组成了一片森林。</p>\n<p>不过，也可以通过简单地移除树中的某些结点来创建森林。</p>\n<p>让我们来看一个例子。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"9054ce55-7dc0-36a0-9553-a7d83c6ef464","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/a5567a22caeb97f56c0d.png","style":"original","caption":"Simple Tree","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":411,"size_in_bytes":15889,"name":"dsa-10.2.18.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"cdab52cc-1da2-32f3-b9a2-3fa203520b53","title":"","title_html":"","text":"当我们删除**根结点**（**A**）时，它的每个子结点（**B**、**C**和**D**）都会变成一棵独立的树。\n\n这样，我们的森林就变成了这样：","text_html":"<p>当我们删除<strong>根结点</strong>（<strong>A</strong>）时，它的每个子结点（<strong>B</strong>、<strong>C</strong>和<strong>D</strong>）都会变成一棵独立的树。</p>\n<p>这样，我们的森林就变成了这样：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b45576d9-d5d1-3caf-baa3-c6102c5ca1bf","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/f47042dc43faf2ee5c86.png","style":"original","caption":"Forest After Removing Root Node","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":369,"size_in_bytes":8022,"name":"dsa-10.2.19.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e74cbf93-9abf-321d-99dc-e038fa72103b","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**B**、**C**和**D**各自形成一棵独立的树，共同组成一片森林。\n\n通过改变我们移除的结点，可以从同一棵树中创建不同的森林集。\n\n让我们从原始树中移除结点 **C** 来观察一下。","text_html":"<p><strong>B</strong>、<strong>C</strong>和<strong>D</strong>各自形成一棵独立的树，共同组成一片森林。</p>\n<p>通过改变我们移除的结点，可以从同一棵树中创建不同的森林集。</p>\n<p>让我们从原始树中移除结点 <strong>C</strong> 来观察一下。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":6},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e659bfe4-963f-3a06-9cd7-09db6cf10c23","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/6f70dbd1e50edff98bda.png","style":"original","caption":"Forest After Removing Node C","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":411,"size_in_bytes":15020,"name":"dsa-10.2.20.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":7},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ad6de498-8860-3ba1-a6af-1203b1bb3860","title":"","title_html":"","text":"现在我们有两棵树，一棵根结点是**A**，有子结点**B**和**D**，另一棵是结点**C**本身。","text_html":"<p>现在我们有两棵树，一棵根结点是<strong>A</strong>，有子结点<strong>B</strong>和<strong>D</strong>，另一棵是结点<strong>C</strong>本身。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":8}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"035","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/035/page/1586"}
